\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 CXO Hive\
CXO Hive is Dr. Mudit Saxena\'92s executive coaching practice. Individual only. Not corporate training.\
What it does\uc0\u8232 \'a0Helps mid-senior operators in India (MNC / GCC / Indian IT) who already deliver. The title and the rooms have not caught up. The work is to make them the obvious next leader, not a better doer.\
What it sells\uc0\u8232 \'a0Paid 1:1 coaching (and cohort / group programs). That is the product.\
Not the product: ebook, Sunday workshop, LinkedIn post, \'93join CXO Hive.\'94\
Positioning\uc0\u8232 \'a0The stall is not performance. It is positioning, sponsorship, presence, and evidence. Hard work got them to mid-senior. It will not get them the next seat.\
